--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a port of the ValueHeads method to the Pythia model suite.
Substantial parts of valueheads_pythia/{hooks,data,probing,directions,eval_generate}.py,
valueheads_pythia/judge/openai_compat.py (judge prompts and client),
valueheads_pythia/analysis/{heatmaps,correlations,direction_angles}.py and
the evaluation prompt sets in data/ are adapted from the reference
implementation

    sihuo-design/valueheads (commit 227612f), MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 Xueqi Ma, Yanbei Jiang, Xingjun Ma, James Bailey,
    Sarah Monazam Erfani

which accompanies the paper

    "ValueHeads" - arXiv:2611.02503 (2026).

The original MIT license text of that repository is reproduced below and
applies to the adapted portions.

